* tafc-emulation: prime
* TAFC-CROSSCHECK.md section 2: operands round half-up to PRECISION.
CRT 0.00004+0.00004, 0.33334*3, 0.06245*1, 0.06255*1, 1.23445*1
CRT -0.00004+0, -0.00005+0, 1-0.99999, 1.99999+0, 12345.67891-0
CRT ('0.33333' = '0.3333'), (0.33335 = 0.3334), ('1.00004' > 1), ('1.00005' > 1)
IF '0.00004' THEN CRT 'true' ELSE CRT 'false'
CRT INT(0.99999), INT(2.99995), ABS(-0.00005), MOD(10.00005, 3)
CRT 0.29*100, 0.1+0.7, 1.1*1.1, 1.23456789
